e-mode auth design. If we're running air-gapped, we can't call home for license validation or user auth, so key rotation can't assume an always-on network either.\\n\\n**[2026-08-02 11:16] Alice**: Right — whatever we design has to keep working with no connection for extended stretches.\\n\\n**[2026-08-02 11:22] Diana**: I'm sketching a rotation flow built around a locally held key rather than one that needs a live call to rotate.\\n\\n**[2026-08-02 13:00] Alice**: How do we actually rotate it if the site is air-gapped?\\n\\n**[2026-08-02 14:24] Diana**: Still working that part out — that's the piece I'm least confident about. I'll have a first draft of the design by Wednesday.\\n\\n**[2026-08-02 14:27] Diana**: I'll loop in Bob once the draft's ready so he can start mocking it for testing.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src slack 16 slack thread offlin mode authent design channel cipherdoc date 2026 08 02 2026 08 02 11 14 diana start on offlin mode auth design if we re run air gap we can t call home for licens valid or user auth so key rotat can t assum an alway on network either 2026 08 02 11 16 alic right whatev we design ha to keep work with no connect for extend stretch 2026 08 02 11 22 diana i m sketch a rotat flow built around a local held key rather than one that need a live call to rotat 2026 08 02 13 00 alic how do we actual rotat it if the site is air gap 2026 08 02 14 24 diana still work that part out that s the piec i m least confid about i ll have a first draft of the design by wednesday 2026 08 02 14 27 diana i ll loop in bob onc the draft s readi so he can start mock it for test\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e91002148a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-02-offline-auth-key-rotation.md\", \"id\": \"d2ce464541afa991\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": nu