uthentication for air-gapped deployments where an always-on network cannot be assumed.\\n\\n## Status\\n\\nActive — design stage.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src gdoc 13 offlin mode authent key rotat design owner diana document key doc 2013 last updat 2026 08 02 constraint t019 must support authent for air gap deploy where an alway on network can not be assum design focus work out a key rotat flow that doe not depend on continu network reachabl sinc the target deploy are air gap sourc id src gdoc 13 offlin mode authent key rotat design owner diana document key doc 2013 last updat 2026 08 02 constraint t019 must support authent for air gap deploy where an alway on network can not be assum open question how rotat behav for a workstat that stay offlin for an extend period ha not been valid yet that check is expect onc a local auth mock exist sourc id src gdoc 13 offlin mode authent key rotat design owner diana document key doc 2013 last updat 2026 08 02 constraint t019 must support authent for air gap deploy where an alway on network can not be assum status activ design stage\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e9a21c808a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-02-Offline-Mode-Authentication-Review.md\", \"id\": \"88c510ac1d8be399\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.31201574836465756, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.0936755548066537, \"vector_similarity\": 0.8214762, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-02-Offline-Mode-Authentication-Review.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9a21c808a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-02-Offline-Mode-Authentication-Review.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-02-Offline-Mode-Authentica